From: yinjiayi <yinjiayi@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pkgconfig: honor the configured GNUInstallDirs library directory

CMake installs the original static library in CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR, which is
lib64 on this target. Bind the generated pkg-config search path to that same
configured directory instead of the hard-coded lib. No source or test changes.

--- a/cargs.pc.in
+++ b/cargs.pc.in
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 prefix=@CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX@
 exec_prefix=${prefix}
-libdir=${exec_prefix}/lib
+libdir=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR@
 includedir=${prefix}/include
 
 Name: @PROJECT_NAME@
